WEBVTT

32:10.163 --> 32:11.581
Get back to work, lad.

32:13.833 --> 32:17.712
If the day ever comes when that boy
would rather wield a sword than forge one,

32:18.796 --> 32:21.216
you send him to me.

32:21.341 --> 32:23.176
(HAMMER BANGING)

32:24.677 --> 32:26.679
Find anything?

32:27.889 --> 32:29.933
King Robert's bastard son.
